{"item":{"key":"moment:4594194","id":"4594194","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1750354524104,"text":"网络限速的问题，查了一下网上的情况还比较严峻，好多地方投诉了也没用。\n明天喊师傅上门看能不能解决。\n超长视频（歌回录像类）传a站300k/s太慢了现在，而且经常是几个小时传上去最后说上传失败，之前还不明白是什么情况，看了一下肥肥说的pcdn大概懂了。录像大家暂时先看sydra师傅和爱咔了吧，什么时候恢复什么时候我这边再补。\n以后直播画质也会降低一些了，没办法。[emot=acfun,2759/]\n限速做直播和视频的用户，运营商你没有心啊！！[emot=acfun,2761/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":86,"likeCount":197,"bananaCount":121,"shareCount":1},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/4594194","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":82,"archivedRoots":52,"commentPages":["comments/4594194/all/1.json","comments/4594194/all/2.json","comments/4594194/all/3.json"],"hotPages":["comments/4594194/hot/1.json"],"threads":{"803400345":{"pages":["comments/4594194/threads/803400345/1.json"],"savedReplies":4,"reportedReplies":4,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"803400345","root":"803400345","user":{"id":"1714600","name":"不吃洋葱芹菜","avatar":"d3c417a56a7abc5439026509"},"text":"有专门的直播宽带，电信198+120，2000M下行，200M上行。我才办了，感觉可以搞一个。","time":1750510557478,"floor":54,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":4,"hot":false}},"803385941":{"pages":["comments/4594194/threads/803385941/1.json"],"savedReplies":5,"reportedReplies":5,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"803385941","root":"803385941","user":{"id":"731028","name":"伊莉丝翠神选巫妖","avatar":"3584b1249ce0e38d9984e50f"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1792/]水姐这都是小问题啦，你们见过商用宽带被限速要求我签非pcdn应用的单子吗？","time":1750401090737,"floor":52,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":5,"hot":false}},"803384110":{"pages":["comments/4594194/threads/803384110/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"803384110","root":"803384110","user":{"id":"35757157","name":"慕老板","avatar":"610fa75ed32811357a448b